  description: If "Obsidim, the Ashened City" is in the Field Zone, you can Special
    Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon "Shaman of the
    Ashened City" once per turn this way. You can target 3 of your Pyro monsters
    that are banished and/or in your GY; shuffle them into the Deck, then if you
    shuffled an "Ashened" monster, you can add 1 "Obsidim, the Ashened City" from
    your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Shaman of the Ashened
    City" once per turn.
